    "title": "Three Forks races in July produce 11 age-group wins, RunSignUp says",
    "text": "Three Forks races in July produce 11 age-group wins, RunSignUp says\nBy\nN. S. MearsAll July 2026 age-group wins in Three Forks, Montana, were recorded at the Headwaters Bank Run, which reported 11 victories, according to RunSignUp.\nThe 5K Run/Walk accounted for six victories, the 1/2 Marathon for three and the 10K Run/Walk for two.\nAge-Group Division Winners in Three Forks, July 2026\n| Participant | Division | Race | Event | Date | Finish Time |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Emma Pillsbury | Female 20-29 |\n|",
